!!! Prior rulings held


''MEASURED (prior-round ruling, confirmed-by-both):'' asker seals. A caused sealed write routes to the admitted tab whose session caused it, else to any admitted unlocked tab of that face, else waits as `seal-awaits-session`; no wall clock decides. ''MEASURED (prior-round ruling, confirmed-by-both):'' shape (i): each PersonaGroup has independently random FCK opened only by that face's own slot tree; VK never wraps FCK. FCK lands inside K15; F6 slice three lands with K15 step 3. Sources: `../PRIOR-YIN.md`, `../PRIOR-YANG.md` (2026-10-19).

