!! YIN — round-four confirmation and lock


Research date: ''2026-10-19''. I read `../PRIOR-YIN.md` and `../PRIOR-YANG.md` first, then `MINE.md` and `TWIN.md`. The repo stayed read-only; I ran no suite, build, or git write. `MEASURED` means source/spec/vendor evidence directly says it; `LEAD` means target allocation or inference. Provenance marks compare the wave-one notes: ''confirmed-by-both'', ''yours-alone'' (YIN/MINE), ''twin-alone'' (YANG/TWIN). File paths below are relative to `/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine`; all external pages were accessed 2026-10-19.

