| ''MCP / watcher seat'' (`codex-wire.ts:70-93`; `vscode-wire.ts:84-150`; `stable-founding-road.mem:201`) | No MCP-local S; node D/F/S governs. | Each MCP session/invocation presents face authority; node boot unlock is separate. | Long-lived MCP transport cannot inherit whichever face last used node; client restart loses its session authority. | Keep A admitted; submit B request without B proof and after MCP restart; both refuse; B succeeds only with B admission. |
