!! YIN wave-two handback — place signer


Research date: ''2026-10-19''. All claims are dated 2026-10-19. ''MEASURED'' means read in source or on a primary project/vendor page; ''LEAD'' means inference or proposed design. Provenance labels: ''confirmed-by-both'' (supported in both YIN and YANG wave-one handbacks), ''yours-alone'' (YIN), ''twin-alone'' (YANG). I read `../PRIOR-YIN.md`, `../PRIOR-YANG.md`, `MINE.md`, and `TWIN.md`. The repository `/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine` remained read-only; no tests, builds, or git writes were run. All edits are confined to this directory.

